{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04390","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 十六 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人去已久，公道缅良难。\n蚩蚩夸毘子，尧禹以爲谩。\n骄荣贵工巧，势利迭相干。\n燕王尊乐毅，分国愿同欢。\n鲁连让齐爵，遗组去邯郸。\n伊人信往矣，感激爲谁叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}